The following example code file named ``HelpersTest.class`` uses JUnit to test the ``SelectNYCTaxis`` function in the ``Helpers.class`` file. Instead of using the time and cost of actual compute resources to call the function in the ``Helpers.class`` file, the following example code uses Mockito to simulate this call. Simulated calls such as this are typically completed in just a few seconds, increasing your confidence in the quality of your code while not changing the state of your existing Databricks accounts or workspaces.java
